@host = http://localhost:5200

### Register a customer
POST {{host}}/api/Customer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "María",
  "lastName": "López",
  "birthDate": "1992-07-15",
  "documentNumber": "001-150792-0003C",
  "gender": "F",
  "monthlyIncome": 2200
}

### Get a customer
GET {{host}}/api/Customer/1

### Open an account (customer must exist)
POST {{host}}/api/BankAccount
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "initialDeposit": 100
}

### Seeded account: details and balance
GET {{host}}/api/BankAccount/1000000001

###
GET {{host}}/api/BankAccount/1000000001/balance

### Deposit
POST {{host}}/api/Transaction/Deposit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountNumber": "1000000001",
  "amount": 50.25
}

### Withdrawal
POST {{host}}/api/Transaction/Withdrawal
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountNumber": "1000000001",
  "amount": 20
}

### Apply interest
POST {{host}}/api/Transaction/Apply-Interest
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountNumber": "1000000001"
}

### Withdrawal above the balance, error in Spanish (Accept-Language: en for English)
POST {{host}}/api/Transaction/Withdrawal
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: es

{
  "accountNumber": "1000000001",
  "amount": 100000
}

### Unknown customer, error in Spanish
GET {{host}}/api/Customer/999999
Accept-Language: es-NI

### Ledger summary
GET {{host}}/api/Transaction/1000000001/summary

### Health
GET {{host}}/health
